1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Every assignment lives somewhere on this map.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Across: how much the student has to think, argue, and stand behind.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Up: how much gets in the way of showing it.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,500
Four corners. One of them teaches.

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,500
When AI replaces the learner's work,
the thinking moves elsewhere.

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Underneath it all: infrastructure.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Sort ten moves yourself. Friction Lab.
